    "summary": "The Piper of Dawn game is a single-player alchemy-shop-farming time-loop RPG developed by Bone Nail and co-published with 2P Games. It launched worldwide on Steam on September 22, 2026 under AppID 3804370, and Steam tags it Indie, RPG, Simulation, and Strategy with Shop Keeper, Farming Sim, Base Bui",
